          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Unisex Tops</h2><p>Stay on point and on trend with our luxury unisex tops made from the softest fibers on Earth. Whether you prefer a classic shirt, pullover hoodie, a zip-up hoodie, or a sophisticated polo, our tops are designed to elevate your daily look.</p><h2>Unisex Bottoms</h2><p>Discover the perfect unisex bottoms that exude quiet luxury. From trousers designed for a polished look to joggers, our collection offers a variety of options to suit your personal taste. Crafted with sustainable materials and attention to detail, our bottoms provide a versatile foundation for any outfit.</p><h2>Unisex Scarves</h2><p>Complete your ensemble with our unisex <a href=\"/collections/the-signature-bleusalt-wrap\" title=\"/collections/the-signature-bleusalt-wrap\">scarves and wraps</a>. Designed to add an extra layer of style and warmth, our accessories are crafted with the same dedication to quality as the rest of our collection. Wrap yourself in luxury and elevate your look with our scarves and wraps, the perfect finishing touches to any outfit.</p><h2>Embrace Sustainable Fashion</h2><p>At Bleusalt, sustainability is a core value that drives our commitment to ethical fashion. Our Unisex Collection is crafted with premium materials, ensuring both luxury and sophistication while minimizing our impact on the environment.</p><h2>Experience the Power of Inclusivity & Sustainability</h2><p>Discover the power of inclusivity with our Unisex Collection. Explore the timeless styles, luxurious fabrics, and versatile designs that transcend traditional gender boundaries. Embrace the freedom to express yourself authentically in Bleusalt.</p><h2>Shop Unisex Clothing by Bleusalt</h2><p>Indulge in the epitome of refined comfort and timeless elegance with Bleusalt's exquisite unisex clothing collection. Elevate your wardrobe to unparalleled levels of sophistication—shop now to experience the allure of quiet luxury firsthand.</p>"
